sequenceDiagram
  participant O as Operator
  participant C as C Vision
  participant E as E Control Station
  participant D as D Auto Controller
  participant A as A Platform
  O->>C: hand enters the playfield (or hides markers)
  C->>E: vision/edit_state hand_present / occluded
  E->>A: game/state paused
  E->>D: game/state paused
  D->>D: stop output
  A->>A: level the plate
  O->>O: moves walls or swaps the plate
  Note over C: still for edit_clear_time_s and plate level
  C->>E: edit_state rescanning
  C->>C: two scans agree and pass validation
  alt walls changed
    C->>E: vision/maze, plan/distance_map (new maze_id)
  else walls unchanged
    C->>E: same maze_id
  end
  C->>E: plan/route from the current ball cell
  alt route valid
    C->>E: edit_state clear
    E->>O: "Maze OK – press Resume"
    O->>E: Resume
    E->>A: game/state playing (same game_id)
    E->>D: game/state playing
  else no_path
    C->>E: edit_state clear, reason no_path
    E->>O: "No path to the exit", Resume disabled
  else scan failed
    C->>E: edit_state not clear, reason scan_invalid / exit_hidden / ...
    E->>O: reason shown, game stays paused
    Note over O,E: manual retry: Read maze, then Resume
  end
